{%- comment -%}
  Besjaar 11.6.18 — page-template polish (About + Zakelijk).

  ABOUT, phones:
  1. Overflow. The hero is a two-column grid with no mobile breakpoint, and
     grid items default to min-width:auto, so a long word ("Douchekoppen.")
     at display size forces its column wider than the viewport. One column
     below 901px, min-width:0 on the items, a headline size that fits, and
     word breaking as a backstop.
  2. Parity with desktop — pill kickers, white photo cards, navy numbers,
     laid out two-up instead of four-up, replacing the original
     green-and-black sideways-scrolling cards.

  ZAKELIJK, every width: the same min-width:auto trap. The hero photo's
  natural width pushed its grid item past the viewport, which scrolled the
  whole page sideways and left the content pinned to the left with an uneven
  margin. The shell width is also pinned here rather than inherited, so the
  section cannot drift out of the page grid.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if request.page_type == 'page' -%}
<style id="besjaar-about-1170">
/* Zakelijk — all widths */
body[data-page-type="page"] .bj-b2b{overflow-x:clip!important}
body[data-page-type="page"] .bj-b2b .ind-shell{box-sizing:border-box!important;width:min(100% - 32px,1240px)!important;max-width:1240px!important;margin-left:auto!important;margin-right:auto!important;padding-left:0!important;padding-right:0!important}
body[data-page-type="page"] .bj-b2b__hero>*,
body[data-page-type="page"] .bj-b2b__quote>*,
body[data-page-type="page"] .bj-b2b__cards>*,
body[data-page-type="page"] .bj-b2b__grid>*{min-width:0!important;max-width:100%!important}
body[data-page-type="page"] .bj-b2b__hero-visual{min-width:0!important;max-width:100%!important;overflow:hidden!important}
body[data-page-type="page"] .bj-b2b__hero-visual img{width:100%!important;max-width:100%!important;height:auto!important}
body[data-page-type="page"] .bj-b2b__title,
body[data-page-type="page"] .bj-b2b h2{overflow-wrap:break-word!important}
body[data-page-type="page"] .bj-b2b__mail{overflow-wrap:anywhere!important}

@media (max-width:900px){
  /* About — overflow guards */
